{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家統計局公布，首10個月全國城鎮調查失業率5.2%，按年持平。<br/>\n<br/>\n10月全國城鎮調查失業率5.1%，按月跌0.1個百分點，創4個月新低。<br/>\n<br/>\n統計局表示，就業形勢總體穩定，城鎮調查失業率下降。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.514179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:27:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:51:45.214239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:44:34.900758+00:00","content_hash":"565c2329524a810c44fc82b71e0d1084e201e302345d0d08f1c35f61c12d44a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}